function inferActionCompletedFromStatus(actionName,result){if(!actionName){return false;}switch(actionName){case "pull_image":return !result.actionRunning&&!result.processConflict&&result.imageStatus=="ready";case "start":case "restart":case "regenerate_key":return !result.actionRunning&&!result.processConflict&&!!result.running;case "stop":return !result.actionRunning&&!result.processConflict&&result.containerExists&&!result.running;case "cleanup_conflict":return !result.actionRunning&&!result.processConflict;case "remove_container":return !result.actionRunning&&!result.processConflict&&!result.containerExists;default:return false;}}
function maybeFinishActionFromStatus(result){var state=result||status_cache||{},actionMatches=false,errorMessage="";if(!current_action_name){return false;}actionMatches=!state.actionName||state.actionName==current_action_name;if(state.processConflict){finishActionWithError(state.processConflictText||"检测到多个 codex-tools-proxyd 进程，请先排查运行状态。");return true;}if(inferActionCompletedFromStatus(current_action_name,state)){finishQuickAction(current_action_success_message||"操作成功");return true;}if(actionMatches&&state.actionStatus=="success"&&!state.actionRunning){finishQuickAction(current_action_success_message||state.actionMessage||"操作成功");return true;}if(actionMatches&&state.actionStatus=="error"){errorMessage=state.actionMessage||state.lastError||state.actionLastLine||"操作已结束，但状态未达到预期，请检查运行日志。";finishActionWithError(errorMessage);return true;}if(state.actionLogDone&&!state.actionRunning&&actionMatches){errorMessage=state.lastError||state.actionLastLine||"操作已结束，但状态未达到预期，请检查运行日志。";finishActionWithError(errorMessage);return true;}return false;}
